WEBVTT

00:00:30.785 --> 00:00:32.637
Last time I was really fast I was 16,

00:00:32.661 --> 00:00:34.943
outrunning a doorman
on the Upper East Side.

00:00:34.967 --> 00:00:37.390
He caught me vandalizing his building,

00:00:37.414 --> 00:00:38.925
not even on some artsy stuff,

00:00:38.949 --> 00:00:40.717
just ... stupid.

00:00:41.345 --> 00:00:45.032
Of all the genders,
boys are the stupidest.

00:00:45.056 --> 00:00:47.136
(Laughter)

00:00:47.160 --> 00:00:50.401
Sixteen was a series of
barely getting away

00:00:50.425 --> 00:00:52.445
and never telling my parents.

00:00:52.469 --> 00:00:55.427
I assume that my son
is stewarding this tradition well.

00:00:56.042 --> 00:01:00.100
Sixteen was "The Low End Theory"
and Marvin Gaye on repeat.